Subject: [PATCH 6/6] W1-P5: Clerk social login, one Clerk application per
 module (req 8)

Google/Facebook/GitHub through each module's own Clerk pool, ending in an ordinary module session.
- migration 128 module_external_identities (+boot mirror), clerk audit events
- per-module Clerk session-token verification (RS256/JWKS), Svix webhook verification
- POST /api/auth/module/clerk, /api/webhooks/clerk/:module, options.social
- no email auto-link (EMAIL_ACCOUNT_EXISTS), user.deleted closes account + revokes sessions
- SPA: social buttons, /clerk/callback, per-module publishable key
- docs/identity-boundaries.md, validate-w1-p5 (+self-test), unit/DB/client tests, CI
- fix: SPA module password login sent `identifier` instead of `email`

